&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/compare/v15.1.0...v16.0.0-beta-1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v15.1.0...v16.0.0-beta-1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release is a beta release that introduces .NET 10 support and package signing. Signed packages means going forward packages can be validated against trusted authorities that the package has been published by Lucky Penny Software and not tampered with.&lt;/p&gt;
